Subject: [PATCH] [M156] Retarget NavigateEvent.sourceElement

FlyWeb next batch: from branch-heads/8078 d1b613c0d8. Applied after seguridad/siguiente/chromium/0003; applies cleanly (identical diff). No brave-core patches or chromium_src for these files.

Original change's description:
> Retarget NavigateEvent.sourceElement
>
> NavigateEvent.sourceElement returned the raw source element, which can
> live inside a shadow tree. In particular, clicking an SVG <a> that is
> cloned into the user-agent shadow tree of a <use> element exposed the
> instance-tree copy of the <a> to script, which could then mutate the
> user-agent shadow tree.
>
> This CL retargets sourceElement, the same way ToggleEvent.source,
> CommandEvent.source and InterestEvent.source already do, so that
> shadow-internal nodes (user-agent, closed, or open) are never exposed.
>
